    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26029" root="ضمر" body-key="D">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَقِيتُهُ بِالضُّمَيْرِ</span></b>  is a phrase mentioned by Sgh [in

the O] as meaning <i>I met him at sunset:</i> but it is
correctly [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِالصُّمَيْرِ</span>,] with the unpointed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ص</span>.
(TA.)

